      "text": "This is a fairly long answer that repeats itself so the conversation has enough tokens to compact. This is a fairly long answer that repeats itself so the conversation has enough tokens to compact. This is a fairly long answer that repeats itself so the conversation has enough tokens to compact. This is a fairly long answer that repeats itself so the conversation has enough tokens to compact. C1-DONE"
